wlers --></a></span> Armour Class</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"1\"><p>13</p></td>\n</tr></tbody></table><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ethereal_Jaunt\" title=\"Ethereal Jaunt\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/40px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/60px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/80px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ethereal Jaunt\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/40px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ethereal_Jaunt\" title=\"Ethereal Jaunt\">Ethereal Jaunt</a> (<span aria-label=\"Bonus Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bonus Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Surrounded by silver mist, you teleport to an unoccupied space you can see. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharg